{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10251130","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10251130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1025113001:0":{"text":"어때요. 문제가 있나요?","source_cn":"怎么样，有问题吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7D829BAD86E8F6AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어때요. 문제가 있나요?","female":"어때요. 문제가 있나요?","variant_male_record_index":"96714","variant_female_record_index":"96715","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1025113001":{"text":"어때요. 문제가 있나요?","source_cn":"怎么样，有问题吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7D829BAD86E8F6AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어때요. 문제가 있나요?","female":"어때요. 문제가 있나요?","variant_male_record_index":"96714","variant_female_record_index":"96715","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1025113002:0":{"text":"마법진에도, 절차에도 문제가 없지만, 결과적으로는 문제가 생겼잖아요. 음, 조작할 때 마법을 어떻게 제어했냐면...","source_cn":"法阵没有问题，步骤没有问题，但结果出了问题。嗯，得考虑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4577BB88DD183D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1025113003:0":{"text":"『마법 실험 수칙』 제12조에 따르면, 마력을 조정하고 변수를 제어하면서 실험을 비교해야 해요.","source_cn":"根据《魔法实验守则》第十二条，我应该调整魔法能量，控制...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282576FD763DEDF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1025113004:0":{"text":"아, 잠시만... ","source_cn":"哎，等等……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC259974B75679F1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1025113005:0":{"text":"이번에 마법진을 활성화하면서 먼저 마력을 10% 정도 더 써볼게요. \n그래도 안 되면 10%를 더 넣고... 다시 활성화해볼게요.","source_cn":"这次激活法阵，我先增加10%的魔法力量。\\n如果还不行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9E9D3A7AF036C51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1025113006:0":{"text":"대마법사 멀린님, 당신의 팬 좀 말리시죠?","source_cn":"我说，大魔法师梅林，你不拦着你的崇拜者吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA4EE57F20D2E0710","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"대마법사 멀린님, 당신의 팬 좀 말리시죠?","female":"대마법사 멀린님, 당신의 팬 좀 말리시죠?","variant_male_record_index":"96720","variant_female_record_index":"96721","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1025113006":{"text":"대마법사 멀린님, 당신의 팬 좀 말리시죠?","source_cn":"我说，大魔法师梅林，你不拦着你的崇拜者吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA4EE57F20D2E0710","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"대마법사 멀린님, 당신의 팬 좀 말리시죠?","female":"대마법사 멀린님, 당신의 팬 좀 말리시죠?","variant_male_record_index":"96720","variant_female_record_index":"96721","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1025113007:0":{"text":"마력을 늘리고, 흡수하고, 유도한 뒤에 응고하면... 이번에는 진전이... 어?","source_cn":"增加能量，汲取、引导、固化，这次好像有进展……咦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ADCCDC28B0F49AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt: